    "text": "A current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> flows through a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> resistor when connected across a battery. The same battery supplies a current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>0.5</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;when connected across a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> resistor. The internal resistance of the battery is"
