  "solution": {
    "text": "Current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> .... (i)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> .... (ii)<br /><br />On dividing equation (i) by equation (ii), we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mtext>0.5</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>"
